  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMU/CRI IAP BiH 2000-01</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PMU/CRI IAP BiH 2000-01</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektte &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning av de integrerarde omr&#xE5;desprogram PMU/CRIgenomf&#xF6;rt med Sida-finansiering i centrala Bosnien sedan 1996. Detta preojekt avser &#xE5;teruppbygga 240 hus i b&#xE5;de Federationsdelen och Republika Srpska. St&#xF6;det omfattar MSEK 14,982, tidplanne f&#xF6;r genom- f&#xF6;rande &#xE4;r 2000-2001.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a contionuation of reconstruction projects in central BiH Sida has financed through PMU/CRI since 1996. This project, which focus on minority return, aim at reconstruction of 240 housse and locainfrastructure, both in the Federation and the RS. Project cost MSEK 14,982, time frame: 2000-2001</narrative>
  </description>
